<p class="lede">Five rooms at Fenner Road, each open to any member during staffed hours.</p>

<h2>Local history room</h2>
<img id="room-local-history" src="/assets/photos/local-history-room.svg" width="480" height="320"
     alt="photo">
<p>First floor, east side. Staffed on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons.</p>

<h2>Children's corner</h2>
<img id="room-childrens" src="/assets/photos/childrens-corner.svg" width="480" height="320"
     alt="image">
<p>Ground floor, beside the main desk. Open whenever the building is.</p>

<h2>Study carrels</h2>
<img id="room-carrels" src="/assets/photos/study-carrels.svg" width="480" height="320"
     alt="picture">
<p>Second floor. Bookable in two-hour slots at the desk or by telephone.</p>

<h2>Newspaper lounge</h2>
<img id="room-newspapers" src="/assets/photos/newspaper-lounge.svg" width="480" height="320"
     alt="graphic">
<p>Ground floor, through the archway. Today's papers and the county weeklies.</p>

<h2>Garden terrace</h2>
<img id="room-terrace" src="/assets/photos/garden-terrace.svg" width="480" height="320"
     alt="photograph">
<p>Open from April to September, weather permitting. Step-free from the rear corridor.</p>
